SHAKI AI Product Match is an AI-powered client intelligence and product recommendation platform designed for SHAKI's international sales team.

Sales representatives simply provide:

* Client's main business categories
* Client website
* Social media information

The system automatically performs:

> Client Research → Client Profile → Product Matching → 6-Dimension Fit Score → Recommendation Reason → Opportunity Detection → Proposal Generation → One-Click Sharing

